Signet
======

This repository offers a typed-signer loader and a patch against the published
@flop-labs/cli@0.5.0 bundle, for https://github.com/flop-labs/network/issues/337.

The FLOP CLI source lives in the private repository flop-labs/flop-core
(sdk/cli). It is not publicly readable, so this is a standalone package plus a
patch against the npm release, not a fork of flop-core.

Credits
-------

@almondous published a limited local prototype of the ed25519:<secret-URI> /
sr25519:<secret-URI> scheme against @flop-labs/cli@0.5.0, with a reconstructed
review artifact and nine grouped checks, on issue #337. This repository
implements that URI scheme as a shared loader, with tests and documentation,
independently of those reconstructed files.

